# This directory is populated at build time by build.bat.
#
# The following files are placed here (sourced from C:\workspace\models\):
#   model.onnx          - fp32 SenseVoiceSmall model
#   tokens.txt          - SenseVoiceSmall token list
#   punct_ct_transformer.onnx  - Chinese/English punctuation model
#   silero_vad.onnx     - Silero VAD model